    "title": "CU Buffs Athletics: News, Scores & Highlights",
    "text": "Get ready, soccer fans! The Colorado Buffaloes have unveiled their highly anticipated 2025 schedule, promising an action-packed season. This article dives deep into the upcoming matchups for the Colorado Buffaloes soccer team, offering insights into key games and providing everything you need too know before the season kicks off. discover the strategies, challenges, and exciting possibilities that await the Buffaloes this year within this exclusive preview.\n“`html\nColorado Buffaloes Unveil Ambitious 2025 Soccer Schedule Boulder, colo. —\nApril 16, 2025\nSeason Overview the university of Colorado Buffaloes are gearing up for an exciting 2025 soccer season, featuring a blend of non-conference challenges and a rigorous Big 12 Conference schedule. With 12 home matches and eight opponents who participated in the 2024 NCAA Tournament, the Buffaloes aim to make a splash. Danny Sanchez , head coach, released the schedule, highlighting key matchups and changes to the Big 12 Tournament format.\nNon-Conference Play : Building Momentum Before diving into the Big 12 gauntlet, Colorado will engage in eight non-conference matches, providing crucial planning and opportunities to fine-tune their strategy.",
